 original line up from the 2024 Game Makers Toolkit Gamejam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maru &amp; Mochi: Adorable cats belonging to our devoloper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni: A Shepsky belonging to our Artist &amp; Designer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harmonia Village: More scenes of critters in the style of the original game art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractals: A challenging series of beautiful (and mathematical!) fractals edited by our artist for maximum aesthetic</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited custom image uploads!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden secrets...</p></li></ul>",
